Avoid the BSD sys/types.h major() macro in the local ellipse variable.

The pkgsrc cad/kicad patch-common_import__gfx_dxf__import__plugin.cpp
(revision 1.1, 2024-04-26) identifies the same conflict. Rename the local
variable instead of removing the system macro from this translation unit.
Adaptation for KiCad 10.0.7: EmberBSD (AI-assisted).

--- a/common/import_gfx/dxf_import_plugin.cpp
+++ b/common/import_gfx/dxf_import_plugin.cpp
@@ -630,7 +630,7 @@
